<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Key Energy started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Key Energy started as buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns started coverage of Key Energy Group Inc Tuesday with a rating of buy, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the company closed Monday at 22-2/16.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
